{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Cap the configurable envelope limit at the checkpoint ceiling.** Validation permits\u2014and the new docs/tests demonstrate\u2014512 KiB, so `OVERFLOW` keeps a 300 KiB payload inline instead of offloading it, despite the 256 KiB direct checkpoint boundary. A step or map using that configuration will fail at checkpoint time. Reject values above the safe maximum, or separate operation-checkpoint and root-response limits, and remove the oversized example/test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7or09c","finding_digest":"6628f77e1bf698b33d1c15848337c17191c315e3d5f723eb808d3883a8a96bb5","finding_id":"arf_v1_myupo7q362mlgpi4cwcign6bog","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::checkpointenvelopelimitbytes::backend-limit-overflow","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::checkpointenvelopelimitbytes::backend-limit-overflow","line":510,"observation_digest":"a6c7112a62e274603539130bc332d1a03e8fa03e367833a6cba31dfbe08f47eb","observation_id":"aro_v1_u3drcktc4j2ganjzcmf4gmwrua","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4cfcdhnhu4cjdwq5ydjdu7e23t","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"75447029a3e45a916d1b015a190c241b810017ed","reviewer":"codex","start_line":507,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_q534zs3nmzgtdxclhtrykmv67u","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
